#. Used in Main/Account/Wallet/WalletView.swift.
msgctxt "bittensor"
msgid "Bittensor"
msgstr "Bittensor"

#. Title of the picker that chooses which Bittensor wallet (Talisman or TAO.com) signs.
msgctxt "bittensor_choose_wallet"
msgid "Choose your Bittensor wallet"
msgstr "Виберіть гаманець Bittensor"

#. Desktop: shown while the browser is open on the wallet page. The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman).
msgctxt "bittensor_continue_in_browser"
msgid "Continue in your browser and approve the request in the {} extension."
msgstr "Продовжте в браузері та схваліть запит у розширенні {}."

#. Bittensor wallet error, on the ur.io wallet card and sign-in, and in the apps when the ur.io bridge page returns address_not_in_wallet: the chosen wallet does not offer the account of the address the user typed (Talisman does not hold it or has not connected it to the site; a WalletConnect wallet connected another account), so nothing was signed. The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman or WalletConnect).
msgctxt "bittensor_error_address_not_in_wallet"
msgid "Your {} wallet doesn't have the address you entered. Add or connect that account in the wallet, or enter an address it has."
msgstr "У вашому гаманці {} немає адреси, яку ви ввели. Додайте або підключіть цей обліковий запис у гаманці чи введіть адресу, яка в ньому є."

#. Error: the single-use wallet challenge expired (5 minutes) before it was signed.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_challenge_expired"
msgid "This request expired. Start again to get a new message to sign."
msgstr "Термін дії цього запиту минув. Почніть знову, щоб отримати нове повідомлення для підпису."

#. Error: the wallet's browser extension is not installed in this browser (on ur.io, or in the apps when a ur.io wallet bridge page returns extension_not_found). The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman on the Bittensor page, Phantom or Solflare on the Solana page).
msgctxt "bittensor_error_extension_not_found"
msgid "The {} extension was not found in this browser. Install it, then try again."
msgstr "Розширення {} не знайдено в цьому браузері. Встановіть його й спробуйте ще раз."

#. Error: the pasted or returned Bittensor signature is not a 64-byte hex signature.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_invalid_signature"
msgid "That is not a valid signature. Paste the full 0x signature from your wallet."
msgstr "Це недійсний підпис. Вставте повний підпис 0x зі свого гаманця."

#. Error: the wallet returned a signature over a different challenge than the one issued.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_message_mismatch"
msgid "The wallet signed a different request. Start again."
msgstr "Гаманець підписав інший запит. Почніть знову."

#. Wallet error in the apps, when a ur.io wallet bridge page returns no_account: the chosen wallet shared no account it can sign with (none is connected to the site, or it holds only accounts of another chain), so nothing was signed. The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman or WalletConnect on the Bittensor page, Phantom or Solflare on the Solana page).
msgctxt "bittensor_error_no_account"
msgid "Your {} wallet has no account to sign with. Add or connect an account in the wallet, then try again."
msgstr "У вашому гаманці {} немає облікового запису для підпису. Додайте або підключіть обліковий запис у гаманці й спробуйте ще раз."

#. Bittensor wallet connect (Earnings), manual entry (TAO.com, or Talisman on a phone): the server refused the pasted signature because it does not verify for the address the user typed over the shown message (POST /sn/wallet error.code signature_mismatch). Usually the user signed with another account in the wallet. The server cannot tell which account signed. The argument is the wallet product name (TAO.com or Talisman).
msgctxt "bittensor_error_signature_mismatch"
msgid "This signature isn't from the address you entered. In {}, sign the message with that address, then paste the signature again."
msgstr "Цей підпис зроблено не з адреси, яку ви ввели. У гаманці {} підпишіть повідомлення з цієї адреси, а потім знову вставте підпис."

#. Wallet error in the apps, when a ur.io wallet bridge page returns user_rejected: the user declined the connection or the signature request in the wallet, so nothing was signed. The Bittensor page (Talisman, or a WalletConnect wallet) and the Solana page of the desktop apps (Phantom or Solflare) both return it; on iOS, Phantom and Solflare decline with 4001, which reads the same.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_user_rejected"
msgid "The request was declined in your wallet. Start again and approve it to continue."
msgstr "Запит відхилено у вашому гаманці. Почніть знову й підтвердьте його, щоб продовжити."

#. Bittensor wallet error in the apps, when the ur.io bridge page returns walletconnect_expired: the WalletConnect pairing or the signature request ran out of time before the wallet answered. WalletConnect is a product name.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_walletconnect_expired"
msgid "The WalletConnect request expired before the wallet answered. Start again."
msgstr "Термін дії запиту WalletConnect минув, перш ніж гаманець відповів. Почніть знову."

#. Bittensor wallet error in the apps, when the ur.io bridge page returns walletconnect_unavailable: the page has no WalletConnect project id, so it cannot pair a wallet. Manual entry still works. WalletConnect is a product name.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_walletconnect_unavailable"
msgid "WalletConnect is not available right now. Try again later, or enter your address manually."
msgstr "WalletConnect зараз недоступний. Спробуйте пізніше або введіть адресу вручну."

#. Manual Bittensor wallet proof: how to sign the shown challenge message. The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman or TAO.com).
msgctxt "bittensor_manual_sign_instructions"
msgid "Sign this message with the {} wallet that holds your coldkey, then paste the address and the signature below."
msgstr "Підпишіть це повідомлення гаманцем {}, у якому зберігається ваш coldkey, а потім вставте нижче адресу й підпис."

#. Label above the challenge message the user signs in their Bittensor wallet.
msgctxt "bittensor_message_to_sign"
msgid "Message to sign"
msgstr "Повідомлення для підпису"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "bittensor_sign_in"
msgid "Sign in with Bittensor"
msgstr "Увійти через Bittensor"

#. Label of the field where the user pastes the Bittensor wallet signature.
msgctxt "bittensor_signature_label"
msgid "Signature"
msgstr "Підпис"

#. Placeholder of the Bittensor signature field (a 0x-prefixed hex signature).
msgctxt "bittensor_signature_placeholder"
msgid "Paste the 0x… signature"
msgstr "Вставте підпис 0x…"

#. Label of the connected wallet block.
msgctxt "bittensor_wallet"
msgid "Bittensor wallet"
msgstr "Гаманець Bittensor"

#. Shown while the browser is open on the WalletConnect page: the user scans the code or opens their wallet app there.
msgctxt "bittensor_walletconnect_continue"
msgid "Continue in your browser: scan the code with your wallet app, or open the wallet on this device."
msgstr "Продовжте в браузері: відскануйте код застосунком гаманця або відкрийте гаманець на цьому пристрої."

#. Subtitle of the WalletConnect option in the Bittensor wallet chooser: which wallets it works with. Nova, Nightly and WalletConnect are product names.
